                                        "entry_id": "84192c1a-bab3-3eb9-b079-410e127a4a3a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Showing willingness to take bold risks; recklessly daring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "faa56e8f-8c96-4ca6-b7c9-46b7f8556bbe",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ffe819-777f-3467-9dfd-8527da528a75",
                                                "text": "It was an audacious thing for her to attempt, but boldness had often served her turn before."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f2dcdd5-19c2-4e45-bff2-dda5a9d4bc41",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ffe819-777f-3467-9dfd-8527da528a75",
                                                "text": "22 March 2012, Scott Tobias, AV Club The Hunger Gameshttp://www.avclub.com/articles/the-hunger-games,71293/\nThat such a safe adaptation could come of The Hunger Games speaks more to the trilogy’s commercial ascent than the book’s actual content, which is audacious and savvy in its dark calculations."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa077c04-9055-4e44-a409-c980c3c4dd5b",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ffe819-777f-3467-9dfd-8527da528a75",
                                                "text": "The audacious hijacking in Paris of a van carrying the baggage of a Saudi prince to his private jet is obviously an embarrassment to the French capital, whose ultra-high-end boutiques have suffered a spate of heists in recent months."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0009eac8-61dc-4641-8dfd-84ed5b953753",
                                                "sense_id": "c0ffe819-777f-3467-9dfd-8527da528a75",
                                                "text": "Cuba’s economy minister described \"audacious\" measures to tame inflation…"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
